REPUBLIC OF CAMEROON   Peace   –   Work   –   Fatherland  NORTH WEST REGIONAL ASSEMBLY  Assemblée Régionale du Nord Ouest · Special Status Region  March 2026 Session · 2025 Accounts   NWRA · Documentation Production Cell   Page 23  accounts; English interfaces and documents for Anglophone regions remain outstanding.  •   Realism of projections:   ambitious projection is intentional and legally sound; the SWOT challenge is to improve accuracy as the institution matures without losing the ability to deploy funds when they arrive.  •   Risk-based manual (Hon. Follow):   the Administrative Manual of Procedures should embed risk identification, quantification, mitigation and a risk register  —   accepted for incorporation.  •   Project maturation instruments:   a civil/geotechnical expert flagged the joint MINMAP/MINTOPI Order of 30 November 2021 and PM Decree No. 2025/01081/PM of 17 March 2025 as mandatory and not to be selectively applied; the President invited the decree be shared for proper implementation.  •   Treasurer name discrepancy (Hon. Goom):   the Treasurer’s name appears in  three forms across documents bound for the State Audit Court; the Presiding Officer directed private reconciliation before transmission.  •   Adoption procedure (Arts. 469 / 471):   the deliberative organ may only adopt or reject   —   not alter   —   administrative accounts; with no impropriety found, the Pro-Term Chair was directed to proceed to adoption, the President remaining present to sign.  5.8 Formal Adoption of the 2025 Accounts  On a motion by Honourable Chechoma Benla, seconded from the floor and from the House of Chiefs, and the Pro-Term Chairperson having confirmed no impropriety, the Assembly proceeded to a vote.

