REPUBLIC OF CAMEROON   Peace   –   Work   –   Fatherland  NORTH WEST REGIONAL ASSEMBLY  Assemblée Régionale du Nord Ouest · Special Status Region  March 2026 Session · 2025 Accounts   NWRA · Documentation Production Cell   Page 42  The recommendations below are flagged by source for ease of follow-up and assignment.  Source   Key Recommendations  Financial Controller  Adopt the procedural manual (incl. PDI); run public- finance workshops; develop an annual commitment plan; strengthen multi-year monitoring; trigger local-tax disbursement; equip and add staff to Finance Control; provide English-language SIMBA / PROGBIS.  Education Committee  Revive hands-on / agriculture subjects; back digital classrooms and seek partners; reopen the National Forum on Education; prioritise classroom-construction debts before the school year.  Admin. & Legal Affairs  Congratulate President/team and Governor; supply physical legal texts (Constitution, 2019 Code, Standing Orders) within two weeks.  Finance Committee  Use CAC funds promptly; transmit functional budgets; press the PM on devolved competencies (6/72; 4 funded); meet a day before budget sessions; mature bankable projects with mayors; one project per subdivision; circulate documents early; keep 40/60 ratio in 2027.  Environment Committee  Tree-planting guide (local species); protect sacred forests, catchments and shrines; involve mayors in water works; draft management guidelines (Fuchi, Folo Bah Paul, Njo Oliver); waste management & World Environment Day; digital mapping.

